[{"client_msg_id":"1d60b3e0-4446-4700-87ac-6e80b4d45aad","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Vim からは eclipse-jdt-ls というのを使うのが現時点ではベストです。やろうと思えば1プロジェクトを Vim で書き上げる事ができます。てか書きました。","ts":"1617749444.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01PQE8LNE9"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n5hW/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2c80f07-2582-4a16-963e-fd6fa58e08ee","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"vim-lsp だと担当が分けられてるので vsnip 入れなければ展開はされないですね。vsnip 十分安定してるけど。","ts":"1617749310.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01PQE8LNE9"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YWh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10055542-e367-4b35-a6b9-fee8491c2d79","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"期待してなかったところで展開されて、決定したという感じですね","ts":"1617747507.017900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yO5s+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee7dd4e6-91f4-4be7-8067-046fd5a00378","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"lspのスニペットが展開されて(orされずに?)決定しちゃったんでしょうかね","ts":"1617747461.017700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZFOF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"804fc81b-5513-41f1-b9af-7e703f25427b","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"それはそれとして、前VimでGoのLSPを試したら、 `if (err != nil) {` の `{` を書いた直後に何故か補完が始まって、エンターで補完確定にしてたので、改行しようとしたら改行のかわりにそこで明らかに不要なコードが挿入されるという不便な体験があったので実はLSPも未だに避けています","ts":"1617742165.016900","edited":{"user":"U01PQE8LNE9","ts":"1617742175.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"F9Cs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33eaa270-2100-4900-b8fe-2f7a905752ee","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"IntelliJ相当の機能が欲しければなんとなく \u003chttps://github.com/google/ijaas\u003e をいじるといける気がするけど、(正直これどう動いてるのかちゃんと見てないですが) IntelliJに直接話しかけるんじゃなくてLSPを話すようなデザインにしておいた方が何かと使い勝手がよさそう (まあ、既存のKotlinのLSPで困らなければその方がシンプルでよさそうですが)","ts":"1617741968.014500","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: google/ijaas","id":1,"title":"google/ijaas","title_link":"https://github.com/google/ijaas","text":"Make IntelliJ as a Java server that does autocompletion for Vim. - google/ijaas","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1342004?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/google/ijaas","original_url":"https://github.com/google/ijaas"}],"edited":{"user":"U01PQE8LNE9","ts":"1617742220.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vxu=f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a430e7fc-933d-4685-b937-4ed0e69e94a0","type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"Javaはvim-javacomplete2でかろうじてVimで書いてたけど、Kotlinのimport補完をVimでするやり方がわからなくてそこで初めてIntelliJとの二刀流にさせられてしまったのでこの話題とても興味あります\n(まあもうそこから2年経って普通に慣れることができたので今更戻すつもりもないんですが、書く時じゃなくて読む時はVimで開くことも未だにあります)","ts":"1617741776.012200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vNrlt"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01PQE8LNE9","text":"\u003c@U01PQE8LNE9\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1617741604.009900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
